  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "さいだい　４にんで　つうわができる\nテレビカメラきのうつきの\nさいしんがた　トランシーバー。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "영상 통화 기능이 내장된\n최신식 무전기.\n최대 4명이 동시에 통화할 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "附影像鏡頭功能，\n最多能讓４人進行通話的\n最新型對講機。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un transmetteur high-tech permettant à quatre\npersonnes de communiquer par le son et l’image.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein hochmodernes Gerät, mit dem bis zu vier\nPersonen miteinander kommunizieren können.\nEs ermöglicht sogar Video-Chat!",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Comunicador de alta tecnología con cámara que\npermite hablar a cuatro personas a la vez.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ricetrasmittente all’avanguardia che permette\ndi fare videochiamate con un gruppo massimo\ndi quattro persone.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A high-tech transceiver with a camera function.\nIt allows up to four-way calls.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
